# Mario 2D Platformer Demo — Environment Configuration
# =====================================================
#
# This project is an offline desktop game (CON-004).
# There are NO environment variables required for operation.
# All game config (physics, level data, sprite paths) is hardcoded
# in Rust constants within src/.
#
# If future features introduce external dependencies, declare them
# in feature-list.json > required_configs[] and add template entries here.
#
# Template format:
#   # <name> — <description>
#   # Hint: <check_hint>
#   # Required by features: <required_by ids>
#   <KEY>=
